OL,3,GNEWSAWhy have pink plaques suddenly
OL,4,Aappeared?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral pink plaques have appeared
OL,7,Fovernight, celebrating locations that
OL,8,Fhave seen major impacts in technology,
OL,9,Fcreativity and culture.
OL,11,FAardman's Creature Comforts film,
OL,12,FNirvana's first UK gig and the
OL,13,Fevolution of trip hop are among the
OL,14,Finfluential moments marked in Bristol
OL,15,Fin the early hours of Wednesday.
OL,17,FBrazen, the organisation that put them
OL,18,Fup, said they were inspired by Historic
OL,19,FEngland's blue plaques, showing where
OL,20,Fan historic person made a significant
OL,21,Fcontribution to society.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
