OL,3,GNEWSAWhy have pink plaques suddenly
OL,4,Aappeared?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Shorrock, chief executive of
OL,7,FTechSPARK, the group behind Brazen,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Bristol's influence reaches far
OL,9,Fbeyond the city, from globally
OL,10,Frecognised creative work to
OL,11,Ftechnologies that have changed people's
OL,12,Flives."
